---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Modul AI Pertemuan 1 | Ovide Academy">
  <section class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <a href="/teaching" class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-800 mb-4 inline-block">&larr; Kembali ke Daftar Modul</a>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-400 font-semibold">07 Juni 2026</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 border border-emerald-200 rounded text-[11px] font-bold">Materi Kuliah</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-3">
        Modul AI Pertemuan 1
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Materi awal pengantar Artificial Intelligence untuk perkuliahan semester awal.
      </p>
      <div class="flex gap-1.5 mt-4">
        <span class="text-[11px] bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-slate-200">#AI</span>
        <span class="text-[11px] bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-slate-200">#Materi Kuliah</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <div class="space-y-6 text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Pertemuan pertama membahas definisi kecerdasan buatan, sejarah singkat, klasifikasi cabang ilmu AI, serta perbedaan mendasar antara pemrograman konvensional berbasis aturan (*rule-based*) dan pembelajaran mesin (*machine learning*).
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2 pt-4">
        Rangkuman Capaian Pembelajaran
      </h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-6 text-sm">
        <li>Memahami konsep dasar *Intelligent Agents* dan lingkungannya (PEAS).</li>
        <li>Mengetahui perbedaan Narrow AI, General AI, dan Super AI.</li>
        <li>Mengenal alur kerja proyek Machine Learning dan Computer Vision.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
